<h3>For the event-focused cyclist</h3>

<p>Trying to lose weight while preparing for a specific, demanding event like a Gran Fondo requires a longer runway. You cannot run a steep caloric deficit while building the endurance required for a 160km ride with 3000 meters of climbing. The deficit must be small, steady, and carefully managed over months, not weeks.</p>

